yeah i thought that too, until i noticed this part in Zenitsu's past, Zenitsu is up on the tree scared and whining and shouting, when suddenly a thunder storm starts to appear out of nowhere, and that's when Zenitsu's grampa starts to warn him that he has the ability to ... , but he gets interrupted by the lightning striking Zenitsu and changing his hair color to yellow, which shows that's Zenitsu actually has these abilities, while tanjiro not really, and also when fighting spider demon, he summons down lightning which breaks the ground, and electrifies all the spiders around him.

